      "question_text": "A solo laner has taken every minion since the first wave and has missed nothing. The cannon minion of wave 9 has just died to the enemy laner instead. Counting only minion gold and ignoring passive income, items, and any kill or assist gold, how far behind is the solo laner at that exact instant?",
