      "category": "league_mechanics",
      "difficulty": 4,
      "choices": [
        "About sixty gold — roughly one and a half melee minions of difference",
        "About ninety gold — the cannon is worth close to three melee minions there",
        "About one hundred and forty gold — the cannon plus the wave it arrived with",
        "About two hundred gold — a full wave of minions, cannon included"
      ],
      "correct_answer": "About ninety gold — the cannon is worth close to three melee minions there",
      "explanation": "Cannon gold is indexed to game time rather than to wave number, and in the wave-9 window it is worth roughly ninety gold, which is close to three melee minions at their own value in that same window. Nothing else in the wave changes hands, so the whole difference is the cannon.",
      "metadata": {
        "wave_number": 9
      }
