      "question_key": "champion_ability_scaling:riven:q:long-explanation",
      "question_text": "Riven's Q — Broken Wings deals 15 (+45% bonus AD) physical damage per cast at rank 1. With 100 bonus attack damage, what does one cast deal before mitigation?",
