      "category": "champion_ability_scaling",
      "difficulty": 3,
      "choices": [
        "45",
        "60",
        "70",
        "160"
      ],
      "correct_answer": "60",
      "explanation": "The ratio is on BONUS attack damage, not total: 15 base plus 45% of 100 bonus AD is 60 physical damage per cast. All three casts of Broken Wings use the same values, so the full chain is 180 before mitigation — but the question asks for a single cast. Reading the ratio as total AD is the common error and would give a number roughly three times too large on a full build."
